docs {
  Run individually and stop the stream manually. Lists file keys, expiry and sizes only.
  Use kind=sets for set keys. Access follows Data visibility unless SlimFaas__ExposeDataMetadata=true.
  See https://slimfaas.dev/user-interface#data-inventory.
}
